avail\n                                nc = cost + need\n                                if 0 not in ndp or ndp[0] > nc:\n                                    ndp[0] = nc\n                        else:\n                            # letter unused: all available characters must be deleted/moved\n                            nc = cost + avail\n                            if 0 not in ndp or ndp[0] > nc:\n                                ndp[0] = nc\n                    dp = ndp\n                # after 26 letters, carry must be 0 (surplus moved past z is deleted)\n                if 0 in dp:\n                    best = min(best, dp[0])\n        return best if best != INF else 0\n"}

