=== MODEL ===
This is a grid DP with a state for how many neutralizations have been used (0, 1, or 2). dp[i][j][k] is the max profit reaching (i, j) having used k neutralizations. At each cell, if coins[i][j] < 0, we can either take the penalty (k unchanged) or neutralize it (k+1, if k < 2, with no penalty). Non-negative cells just add their value regardless of k. The answer is the max over k of dp[m-1][n-1][k].

