=== MODEL ===
With at most 10 points, I can brute force: choose every pair of points as opposite corners (x1 < x2, y1 < y2), check the other two corners exist, and then verify no other point lies within the closed rectangle (inside or on the border). Points on the border other than the four corners also disqualify it, as the problem requires.

